OL,3,GNEWSALondon's mobile data demand
OL,4,Aoutstrips capacity
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon areas with weak mobile phone
OL,7,Fsignals have been highlighted in an
OL,8,Finteractive map released by City Hall.
OL,10,FThe research, carried out by data firm
OL,11,FOokla tested 19 outdoor locations in
OL,12,Fnine inner London boroughs during
OL,13,Fweekday working hours and over the
OL,14,Fwinter shopping period.
OL,16,FIt found every area tested had slower
OL,17,Fnetwork response times than regulator
OL,18,FOfcom's target of 50 milliseconds.
OL,19,FEversholt Street in Somers Town,
OL,20,FCamden, and Dalston in Hackney were the
OL,21,Fworst areas tested.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
